  "title": "Death By Chocolate V",
  "description": "A delightful chocolate Bundt cake made from scratch with sour cream and studded with chocolate chips. For a variation, replace 1/4 cup of the water with Grand Marnier.",
  "authors": [
    "Buffy Hyler"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:06:16-04:00",
